(62, 3, '💫 HADIYTH NAMBA 06.', '💫 HADIYTH NAMBA 06.', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '🍁 Alikuwa Mtume (ﷺ) akitaka kulala anaweka mkono wake wa kulia chini ya shavu lake, kisha anasema:', '🍁 Alikuwa Mtume (ﷺ) akitaka kulala anaweka mkono wake wa kulia chini ya shavu lake, kisha anasema:', 1, '✍️ Abu Daawuud (04/311) na tamko ni lake. Tazama ”Swahiyh-ut-Tirmidhiy” (03/143).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, 1, '2026-09-07 00:09:38', '2026-09-07 00:24:05'),
