(1807, 406, 7, 'إِنَّ اللَّـهَ مَعَ الَّذِينَ اتَّقَوا وَّالَّذِينَ هُم مُّحْسِنُونَ ﴿١٢٨﴾', '<p><strong>إِنَّ اللَّـهَ مَعَ الَّذِينَ اتَّقَوا وَّالَّذِينَ هُم مُّحْسِنُونَ ﴿١٢٨﴾</strong></p>', 'swahili', 'ltr', 7, '#b99137', '#ffffff', '2026-08-27 08:57:46', '2026-08-27 08:57:46', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0),
(1808, 406, 8, '((Hakika Allaah Yu Pamoja na wenye taqwa, na wale ambao wao ni wenye kufanya ihsaan.))[An-Nahl (16: 128).]', '<p>((Hakika Allaah Yu Pamoja na wenye taqwa, na wale ambao wao ni wenye kufanya ihsaan.<strong>))</strong><a href=\"https://www.alhidaaya.com/sw/al-uswuwl-ath-thalaathah-misingi-mitatu-alausanwlu-althwalatht-word-doc-chapisho-la-4-kimehaririwa#_ftn45\"><strong>[An-Nahl (16: 128).]</strong></a></p>', 'swahili', 'ltr', 8, '#1f2937', '#ffffff', '2026-08-27 08:57:46', '2026-08-27 08:57:46', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0),
